msgid ""
"Expanded the *math.gcd()* function to handle multiple arguments. "
"Formerly, it only supported two arguments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:104
msgid ""
"Added *math.lcm()*: return the least common multiple of specified "
